{"n": 623, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "623.webp", "text": "3311151 REPLACING SHAFT SEAL FOR\nDRIVE FLANGE\n\nUnscrew output shaft on drive flange and\nsuspend it on a piece of wire.\nInstallation:\n\nUse washers.\n\nTightening torque”.\n\nPress off drive flange with tire irons.\n\nInstallation:\n\nPrior to installation of drive flange, place\nwire snap ring (1) in groove of differential\ncase that both ends of wire snap ring are\nrecessed in groove.\n\nThis will prevent lateral bending of ring.\nPress in drive flange by hand and turn slightly\nuntil wire snap ring is heard to engage.\nReplace stretched wire snap rings.\n\n* See Specifications\n\nPull out shaft seal with Special Tool 00 5 010\nin conjunction with 8 pressure piece\n\nInstallation:\n\nDip shaft seal in final drive oil.\n\nDrive in shaft seal against stop with Special\nTool 33 1 260 or 33 1 230.\n\nReplace drive flange with a seriously scored\nbearing surface.", "words": [["3311151", 0.2675, 0.0703, 0.3161, 0.0822], ["REPLACING", 0.3303, 0.071, 0.3941, 0.0822], ["SHAFT", 0.3982, 0.071, 0.4347, 0.0822], ["SEAL", 0.4377, 0.0716, 0.4666, 0.0822], ["FOR", 0.4711, 0.0716, 0.4934, 0.0829], ["DRIVE", 0.3303, 0.0869, 0.3647, 0.0981], ["FLANGE", 0.3698, 0.0869, 0.4144, 0.0981], ["Unscrew", 0.2675, 0.1194, 0.3085, 0.13], ["output", 0.3121, 0.1214, 0.345, 0.1326], ["shaft", 0.3485, 0.1194, 0.3718, 0.1306], ["on", 0.3749, 0.1227, 0.387, 0.1306], ["drive", 0.3901, 0.12, 0.4144, 0.1313], ["flange", 0.4179, 0.12, 0.4463, 0.1333], ["and", 0.4493, 0.1207, 0.4666, 0.1313], ["suspend", 0.267, 0.1359, 0.305, 0.1485], ["it", 0.309, 0.1359, 0.3161, 0.1459], ["on", 0.3191, 0.1379, 0.3318, 0.1466], ["a", 0.3349, 0.1379, 0.3404, 0.1466], ["piece", 0.3435, 0.1359, 0.3678, 0.1485], ["of", 0.3708, 0.1359, 0.381, 0.1472], ["wire.", 0.3845, 0.1366, 0.4073, 0.1472], ["Installation:", 0.267, 0.1519, 0.3257, 0.1631], ["Use", 0.2675, 0.1678, 0.2847, 0.179], ["washers.", 0.2877, 0.1678, 0.3283, 0.179], ["Tightening", 0.2675, 0.183, 0.31